0" x2="192" y2="520"/><line x1="240" y1="0" x2="240" y2="520"/><line x1="288" y1="0" x2="288" y2="520"/><line x1="336" y1="0" x2="336" y2="520"/><line x1="384" y1="0" x2="384" y2="520"/><line x1="432" y1="0" x2="432" y2="520"/><line x1="480" y1="0" x2="480" y2="520"/><line x1="528" y1="0" x2="528" y2="520"/><line x1="576" y1="0" x2="576" y2="520"/><line x1="624" y1="0" x2="624" y2="520"/><line x1="672" y1="0" x2="672" y2="520"/><line x1="720" y1="0" x2="720" y2="520"/><line x1="768" y1="0" x2="768" y2="520"/><line x1="816" y1="0" x2="816" y2="520"/><line x1="864" y1="0" x2="864" y2="520"/><line x1="912" y1="0" x2="912" y2="520"/><line x1="960" y1="0" x2="960" y2="520"/><line x1="1008" y1="0" x2="1008" y2="520"/><line x1="1056" y1="0" x2="1056" y2="520"/><line x1="1104" y1="0" x2="1104" y2="520"/><line x1="1152" y1="0" x2="1152" y2="520"/><line x1="1200" y1="0" x2="1200" y2="520"/><line x1="1248" y1="0" x2="1248" y2="520"/><line x1="1296" y1="0" x2="1296" y2="520"/><line x1="1344" y1="0" x2="1344" y2="520"/><line x1="1392" y1="0" x2="1392" y2="520"/><line x1="1440" y1="0" x2="1440" y2="520"/><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="1440" y2="0"/><line x1="0" y1="48" x2="1440" y2="48"/><line x1="0" y1="96" x2="1440" y2="96"/><line x1="0" y1="144" x2="1440" y2="144"/><line x1="0" y1="192" x2="1440" y2="192"/><line x1="0" y1="240" x2="1440" y2="240"/><line x1="0" y1="288" x2="1440" y2="288"/><line x1="0" y1="336" x2="1440" y2="336"/><line x1="0" y1="384" x2="1440" y2="384"/><line x1="0" y1="432" x2="1440" y2="432"/><line x1="0" y1="480" x2="1440" y2="480"/></g></svg><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="chip as-built">As-built: proof of concept running — gate test 10/10</div><h1>Self-Improving Agent Studio</h1><p class="tagline">Any employee builds a personal AI agent in five minutes. Every run makes it better.</p><div class="hero-meta"><span>Team Agent Builder</span><span>From Bob to Business Impact</span><span>2025-07-10</span></div></div><div class="hero-number"><div class="hero-value">Prompt tweaking → one click</div><div class="hero-label">from iterating a prompt by hand to an agent that improves itself from your feedback</div><span class="basis assumption" title="Based on observed behaviour of knowledge workers who repeatedly copy-paste and adjust prompts in generative AI tools. Measurable in the pilot: compare time-to-acceptable-output before and after."><i></i>Assumption</span><p class="hero-note">The improvement loop is the claim. The pilot will measure it.</p></div></div></header><section id="problem"><div class="wrap"><header class="sec-head"><div class="kicker"><b>01</b>Problem</div><h2>Every knowledge worker has a repeating task. Nobody has an agent that gets better at it.</h2><p class="lead">Generative AI tools are available in most organisations. Employees use them by copy-pasting the same prompt, tweaking it when the result is wrong, and starting over next time. Nothing is saved. Nothing improves.</p></header><div class="split"><dl class="facts"><div class="fact-row"><dt>Who lives with it</dt><dd>Knowledge workers in HR, legal, finance, operations and customer service who produce the same type of structured output — reports, response emails, briefings, summaries — repeatedly, from company documents and internal data.</dd></div><div class="fact-row"><dt>What happens today</dt><dd>The employee opens a chat interface, pastes their prompt, reads the result, edits the prompt, pastes it again. When the result is finally good, the improved prompt is forgotten. The cycle repeats next time.</dd></div><div class="fact-row"><dt>What it costs</dt><dd>Time lost to prompt iteration on every run, accumulated across every knowledge worker who does this daily. The agent that already knows what &#x27;good&#x27; looks like for this person and this task does not exist yet.</dd></div><div class="fact-row"><dt>Why now</dt><dd>LLMs are good enough to generate and accept prompt improvements from plain-language feedback. The missing piece is not the model — it is the loop that captures the feedback and closes it.</dd></div></dl><div><div class="tiles"><div class="tile"><div class="tile-value">~45 min</div><div class="tile-label">estimated time per week per worker lost to prompt iteration</div><span class="basis assumption" title="Pilot measurement planned: time-log two workers for one week before and after. Assumption: 3 runs per day, 5 min iteration each."><i></i>Assumption</span></div><div class="tile"><div class="tile-value">0%</div><div class="tile-label">of prompt improvements are retained across sessions in current tools</div><span class="basis estimate" title="ChatGPT, Copilot and similar tools do not persist per-task prompt tuning between sessions by default."><i></i>Estimate</span></div><div class="tile"><div class="tile-value">10–30%</div><div class="tile-label">of a white-collar workforce does recurring structured output work</div><span class="basis assumption" title="Internal survey in the pilot organisation; or HR headcount data by role."><i></i>Assumption</span></div></div><blockquote>Every week I write the same kind of email. Every week I have to tell the AI what tone to use. Why doesn&#x27;t it remember?<cite>Customer service manager (representative quote)</cite></blockquote></div></div></div></section><section id="process"><div class="wrap"><header class="sec-head"><div class="kicker"><b>02</b>Process</div><h2>Six manual steps and no memory become <strong>three steps and an agent that learns</strong></h2><p class="lead">The change is not speed. It is retention: the agent accumulates the user&#x27;s taste and applies it without being asked.</p></header><figure class="flow before"><figcaption><span class="flow-name">Today — manual prompt iteration</span><span class="flow-stats"><b>6</b> steps · <b>0</b> hand-offs · <b>1</b> roles · <b>40 min</b> end to end</span></figcaption><div class="scroll"><svg class="diagram lanes" viewBox="0 0 1120 106" role="img" aria-label="Process diagram" direction="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect class="lane" x="0.5" y="1" width="1119" height="104"/><text class="lane-title" x="16" y="57" font-size="12" text-anchor="start">Employee</text><rect class="lane-frame" x="0.5" y="1" width="1119" height="104" rx="12"/><path class="flow" d="M289.7 53 L306.7 53"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="311.7,53 304.7,57 304.7,49"/><path class="flow" d="M452.3 53 L469.3 53"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="474.3,53 467.3,57 467.3,49"/><path class="flow" d="M615 53 L632 53"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="637,53 630,57 630,49"/><path class="flow" d="M777.7 53 L794.7 53"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="799.7,53 792.7,57 792.7,49"/><path class="flow" d="M940.3 53 L957.3 53"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="962.3,53 955.3,57 955.3,49"/><g class="step manual"><rect class="step-box" x="149" y="15" width="140.7" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="219.3" y="49" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Opens AI chat tool</text><text class="step-time" x="219.3" y="64.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">2 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="151" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="151" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">1</text></g><g class="step manual"><rect class="step-box" x="311.7" y="15" width="140.7" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="382" y="42" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Pastes or rewrites</text><text class="step-title" x="382" y="56" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">prompt from memory</text><text class="step-time" x="382" y="71.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">8 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="313.7" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="313.7" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">2</text></g><g class="step manual"><rect class="step-box" x="474.3" y="15" width="140.7" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="544.7" y="49" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Reads the result</text><text class="step-time" x="544.7" y="64.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">5 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="476.3" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="476.3" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">3</text></g><g class="step decision"><rect class="step-box" x="637" y="15" width="140.7" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="707.3" y="42" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Judges quality, edits</text><text class="step-title" x="707.3" y="56" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">prompt</text><text class="step-time" x="707.3" y="71.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">10 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="639" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="639" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">4</text></g><g class="step manual"><rect class="step-box" x="799.7" y="15" width="140.7" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="870" y="42" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Runs again until</text><text class="step-title" x="870" y="56" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">acceptable</text><text class="step-time" x="870" y="71.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">10 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="801.7" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="801.7" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">5</text></g><g class="step manual"><rect class="step-box" x="962.3" y="15" width="140.7" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="1032.7" y="42" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Copies result to</text><text class="step-title" x="1032.7" y="56" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">destination manually</text><text class="step-time" x="1032.7" y="71.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">5 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="964.3" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="964.3" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">6</text></g></svg></div><div class="timebar"><div class="timebar-fill" style="width:100%"><span class="seg manual" style="flex:2 1 0" title="1. Opens AI chat tool: 2 min"></span><span class="seg manual" style="flex:8 1 0" title="2. Pastes or rewrites prompt from memory: 8 min"></span><span class="seg manual" style="flex:5 1 0" title="3. Reads the result: 5 min"></span><span class="seg decision" style="flex:10 1 0" title="4. Judges quality, edits prompt: 10 min"></span><span class="seg manual" style="flex:10 1 0" title="5. Runs again until acceptable: 10 min"></span><span class="seg manual" style="flex:5 1 0" title="6. Copies result to destination manually: 5 min"></span></div></div></figure><figure class="flow after"><figcaption><span class="flow-name">With the Agent Studio</span><span class="flow-stats"><b>3</b> steps · <b>2</b> hand-offs · <b>2</b> roles · <b>6 min</b> end to end</span></figcaption><div class="scroll"><svg class="diagram lanes" viewBox="0 0 1120 210" role="img" aria-label="Process diagram" direction="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect class="lane" x="0.5" y="1" width="1119" height="104"/><text class="lane-title" x="16" y="57" font-size="12" text-anchor="start">Employee</text><rect class="lane alt" x="0.5" y="105" width="1119" height="104"/><text class="lane-title" x="16" y="161" font-size="12" text-anchor="start">Agent</text><rect class="lane-frame" x="0.5" y="1" width="1119" height="208" rx="12"/><path class="flow" d="M303 53 L308.5 53 Q314 53 314 58.5 L314 154 Q314 157 317 157 L320 157"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="325,157 318,161 318,153"/><path class="flow" d="M479 157 L484.5 157 Q490 157 490 151.5 L490 56 Q490 53 493 53 L496 53"/><polygon class="flow-head" points="501,53 494,57 494,49"/><g class="step manual"><rect class="step-box" x="149" y="15" width="154" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="226" y="49" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Opens agent, pastes input</text><text class="step-time" x="226" y="64.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">2 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="151" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="151" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">1</text></g><g class="step ai"><rect class="step-box" x="325" y="119" width="154" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="402" y="139" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Runs with grounded</text><text class="step-title" x="402" y="153" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">instructions, delivers</text><text class="step-title" x="402" y="167" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">output</text><text class="step-time" x="402" y="182.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">1 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="327" cy="121" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="327" y="124.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">2</text></g><g class="step decision"><rect class="step-box" x="501" y="15" width="154" height="76" rx="9"/><text class="step-title" x="578" y="42" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">Rates result, accepts</text><text class="step-title" x="578" y="56" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle">suggested improvement</text><text class="step-time" x="578" y="71.5" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle">3 min</text><circle class="step-num-bg" cx="503" cy="17" r="9"/><text class="step-num" x="503" y="20.5" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">3</text></g></svg></div><div class="timebar"><div class="timebar-fill" style="width:15%"><span class="seg manual" style="flex:2 1 0" title="1. Opens agent, pastes input: 2 min"></span><span class="seg ai" style="flex:1 1 0" title="2. Runs with grounded instructions, delivers output: 1 min"></span><span class="seg decision" style="flex:3 1 0" title="3. Rates result, accepts suggested improvement: 3 min"></span></div></div></figure><p class="bar-note">The bar under each diagram is its elapsed time, both on one scale.</p><div class="legend"><span class="key k-manual"><i></i>Manual work</span><span class="key k-decision"><i></i>Decision</span><span class="key k-ai"><i></i>Done by the agent</span></div><div class="tiles four"><div class="tile"><div class="tile-label">End-to-end time</div><div class="tile-pair"><s>40 min</s><span class="to">→</span><b>6 min</b></div><div class="delta good">7× less</div></div><div class="tile"><div class="tile-label">Hands-on time</div><div class="tile-pair"><s>40 min</s><span class="to">→</span><b>5 min</b></div><div class="delta good">8× less</div></div><div class="tile"><div class="tile-label">Steps</div><div class="tile-pair"><s>6</s><span class="to">→</span><b>3</b></div><div class="delta good">−50%</div></div><div class="tile"><div class="tile-label">Hand-offs</div><div class="tile-pair"><s>0</s><span class="to">→</span><b>2</b></div><div class="delta flat"></div></div></div><p class="fine"><span class="basis assumption" title="Before: observed in customer service teams; after: the target the PoC is built to meet. Pilot will measure both."><i></i>Assumption</span> Step times: Before: observed in customer service teams; after: the target the PoC is built to meet. Pilot will measure both..</p></div></section><section id="architecture"><div class="wrap"><header class="sec-head"><div class="kicker"><b>03</b>Architecture</div><h2>watsonx.ai is the engine and the coach — Bob is where it is built</h2><p class="lead">The studio is three screens over a single agent loop. watsonx.ai runs the agent and generates the improvement suggestion. Company knowledge is a grounding context, not a fine-tuned model.</p></header><figure class="arch-fig"><div class="scroll"><svg class="diagram arch" viewBox="0 0 1120 898" role="img" aria-label="Architecture diagram" direction="ltr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect class="band" x="0.5" y="6" width="1119" height="118" rx="12"/><text class="band-title" x="20" y="69" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="start">PEOPLE</text><rect class="band" x="0.5" y="186" width="1119" height="118" rx="12"/><text class="band-title" x="20" y="249" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="start">EXPERIENCE</text><rect class="band" x="0.5" y="366" width="1119" height="118" rx="12"/><text class="band-title" x="20" y="429" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="start">AGENTS &amp; MO